From 5c758c07258d7c4c9dc771608d27e505a8b99d3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Mueller <claude@philipmueller.ch>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:31:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(harbor_agent): pi from the release tree the sandbox
 platform mounts

pi_install: mounted with pi_bin (e.g. /opt/rl-tools/pi/1.5.2/pi/pi on Breithorn, a read-only image
volume with the release tree, so pi's package.json sits next to the executable): no archive, no
pi_archive_dir or digest needed; setup runs installed_compat.check_mounted_binary (executable,
`--version` = version, else agent setup fails as a failed install), and the run calls pi by that
path. upload stays the default.

Signed-off-by: Philip Mueller <claude@philipmueller.ch>
---
